{"content":"Fixed — `.fah/packages.yaml` is removed from this PR (`git rm`); the hub-disable workaround for #988 will ship in its own PR.

Worth noting: this file was also the root cause of the failing **Headless Chrome suite** CI check. The Playwright `dap.spec.ts` tests spawn the CLI with `cwd: repoRoot` and `loadPackagesConfig` reads `<cwd>/.fah/packages.yaml` (`lib/src/plugins/packages_config.dart`), so the committed `hub: false` disabled the hub plugin for the spawned CLI agent — both hub-dependent DAP e2e tests timed out after 60s waiting for a DM that could never route. With the file removed, the checkout no longer disables the hub; the suite re-runs on push.
